rom the broken v3.4.0 to the last known-healthy release **v3.3.0** across all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The service is now confirmed **healthy** with the error rate down from ~18% to ~0.2%.\n\n**Incident** \u2014 Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for payments-worker, documenting that the v3.4.0 deploy caused the errors and that a rollback to v3.3.0 restored health. On-call has been paged.\n\nv3.4.0 should not be redeployed until the root cause of the error spike is investigated.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "I'll check the payments service status and its deployment history to find the last healthy release.", "reasoning_content": "Check deployments and status first.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a150ba11c67646ae21902a", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a150ba11c67646ae21902b", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments\"}", "name": "list_deployments"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "The service name \"payments\" isn't recognized. Let me try a few likely variants with read-only status checks to find the actual service.", "reasoning_content": "Unknown service \"payments\". No deployment history. I need to figure out the actual service name. I have no list-services tool. I can't enumerate services. Maybe try common variants? That's risky guessing. Let me try a couple of plausible names like \"payment-service\", \"payments-service\"? Guessing services with tools that only read is safe (get_service_status is read-only). Try a few read-only probes.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a150ba16f876ddbc9d5b0f", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payment-service\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01