nt** \u2014 Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2) for payments-worker, documenting that the v3.4.0 deploy caused the errors and that a rollback to v3.3.0 restored health. On-call has been paged.\n\nv3.4.0 should not be redeployed until the root cause of the error spike is investigated.", "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": []}]}